{"fileNodes":[{"id":"file:code/server/index.js","type":"file","name":"index.js","filePath":"code/server/index.js","summary":"Express 后端服务入口文件，挂载 CORS 和 JSON 中间件，注册 /api/decks、/api/learn、/api/ai 三个路由模块，提供健康检查端点和全局错误处理，监听 3001 端口。","tags":["entry-point","server","express","middleware"]},{"id":"file:code/server/routes/ai.js","type":"file","name":"ai.js","filePath":"code/server/routes/ai.js","summary":"AI 相关路由模块，提供 POST /api/ai/test（测试 AI 连接）和 GET /api/ai/presets（获取预设模型配置）两个端点，依赖 aiService 处理业务逻辑。","tags":["api-handler","route","express","ai"]},{"id":"file:code/server/routes/decks.js","type":"file","name":"decks.js","filePath":"code/server/routes/decks.js","summary":"牌组相关路由模块，提供 GET /api/decks（获取 ShiYi 牌组列表）、GET /api/decks/status（检查 Anki-Connect 连接状态）和 GET /api/decks/all（调试端点返回全部牌组），依赖 ankiService 处理业务逻辑。","tags":["api-handler","route","express","anki"]},{"id":"file:code/server/routes/learn.js","type":"file","name":"learn.js","filePath":"code/server/routes/learn.js","summary":"学习流程核心路由模块，编排完整的卡片学习生命周期：POST /start（开始学习并生成 AI 场景）、POST /respond（用户回复后 AI 评判掌握程度）、POST /complete（完成当前卡片并更新 Anki）、POST /next（获取下一张卡片）、GET /progress（查询学习进度），协调 ankiService、aiService 和 sessionService 三个服务层。","tags":["api-handler","route","express","learning-flow","orchestration"]},{"id":"file:code/server/services/aiService.js","type":"file","name":"aiService.js","filePath":"code/server/services/aiService.js","summary":"AI 多模型服务层，封装 OpenAI 兼容 API 调用，支持千问/豆包/OpenAI 等模型提供商，提供学习场景生成（generateScenario）和用户回复评判（judgeResponse）两大核心能力，内置鲁棒的 AI JSON 响应解析器（parseAIJson）处理各模型不规范的 JSON 输出。","tags":["service","ai","openai","scenario-generation","nlp"]},{"id":"file:code/server/services/ankiService.js","type":"file","name":"ankiService.js","filePath":"code/server/services/ankiService.js","summary":"Anki-Connect API 服务层，封装与本地 Anki 应用的 JSON-RPC 通信（localhost:8765），提供牌组查询、到期卡片获取、已知词汇收集、卡片评分提交和连接状态检查等功能，特别处理 Windows 下中文牌组名 UTF-8 编码问题（统一使用 did: 牌组 ID 查询）。","tags":["service","anki","anki-connect","flashcard","json-rpc"]},{"i